{"addedOn":10,"avgRating":["fa fa-star-o","fa fa-star-o","fa fa-star-o","fa fa-star-o","fa fa-star-o"],"breadcrumbsHtml":"<a href=\"https://docs-be.progress.com/bundle/openedge-abl-reference-117\">OpenEdge Development: ABL Reference</a>\n<span><i class=\"fa fa-angle-right\"></i>\n</span>\n<a href=\"https://docs-be.progress.com/bundle/openedge-abl-reference-117/page/ABL-Syntax-Reference.html\">ABL Syntax Reference</a>\n<span><i class=\"fa fa-angle-right\"></i>\n</span>\n<span class=\"active\">GENERATE-RANDOM-KEY function</span>\n","class":"manual","created":1470,"dislikeurl":"https://docs-be.progress.com/dislike/309553","html":"<article class=\"hascomments\" data-page=\"bundle:openedge-abl-reference-117/enus/GENERATE-RANDOM-KEY-function.html\" id=\"bundle:openedge-abl-reference-117/enus/GENERATE-RANDOM-KEY-function.html\"><main role=\"main\"><article aria-labelledby=\"ariaid-title1\" class=\"dita\" id=\"GENERATE-RANDOM-KEY-function\" role=\"article\">\n  <h1 class=\"title topictitle1 reference\" id=\"ariaid-title1\">GENERATE-RANDOM-KEY function</h1>\n  \n  <div class=\"body refbody\">\n    <section class=\"section\">\n      <p class=\"p\">Generates a pseudorandom (rather than a truly random)\nseries of bytes to use as an encryption key, and returns the key\nas a RAW value.</p>\n    </section>\n    <section class=\"section\" id=\"GENERATE-RANDOM-KEY-function__syntax_GC18M72693330\"><h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\" id=\"d356225e96\">Syntax</h2>\n      \n      <table class=\"table frame-all\" id=\"GENERATE-RANDOM-KEY-function__idGDL2HD2671008\"><caption></caption><colgroup><col style=\"width:100%\" /></colgroup><tbody class=\"tbody\">\n            <tr class=\"row rowsep-0\">\n              <td class=\"entry colsep-1 rowsep-1\">\n                <pre class=\"pre codeblock\"><code>GENERATE-RANDOM-KEY</code></pre>\n              </td>\n            </tr>\n          </tbody></table>\n    </section>\n    <section class=\"section\" id=\"GENERATE-RANDOM-KEY-function__notes_GC18M82693334\"><h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\" id=\"d356225e122\">Notes</h2>\n      \n      <ul class=\"ul\">\n        <li class=\"li\">You\nare responsible for generating, storing, and transporting this value.</li>\n        <li class=\"li\">The size of the generated encryption key is determined by the\ncryptographic algorithm specified by the SYMMETRIC-ENCRYPTION-ALGORITHM\nattribute.</li>\n        <li class=\"li\">The Alternate Random Number Generator (<code class=\"ph codeph\">-rand</code>)\nstartup parameter setting has no effect on this function.</li>\n      </ul>\n    </section>\n    <section class=\"section\" id=\"GENERATE-RANDOM-KEY-function__see-also_GC18M92693340\"><h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\" id=\"d356225e143\">See also</h2>\n      \n      <p class=\"p\">\n        <a class=\"xref\" data-bundleid=\"openedge-abl-reference-117\" data-navpath=\"GENERATE-PBE-KEY-function.html\" href=\"https://docs-be.progress.com/bundle/openedge-abl-reference-117/page/GENERATE-PBE-KEY-function.html\">GENERATE-PBE-KEY function</a>, <a class=\"xref\" data-bundleid=\"openedge-abl-reference-117\" data-navpath=\"SECURITY-POLICY-system-handle.html\" href=\"https://docs-be.progress.com/bundle/openedge-abl-reference-117/page/SECURITY-POLICY-system-handle.html\">SECURITY-POLICY system handle</a></p>\n    </section>\n  </div>\n<nav role=\"navigation\"><div class=\"familylinks\"><div class=\"previouslink\"><strong>Previous topic:</strong> <a class=\"link\" data-bundleid=\"openedge-abl-reference-117\" data-navpath=\"GENERATE-PBE-SALT-function.html\" href=\"https://docs-be.progress.com/bundle/openedge-abl-reference-117/page/GENERATE-PBE-SALT-function.html\">GENERATE-PBE-SALT function</a></div><div class=\"nextlink\"><strong>Next topic:</strong> <a class=\"link\" data-bundleid=\"openedge-abl-reference-117\" data-navpath=\"GENERATE-UUID-function.html\" href=\"https://docs-be.progress.com/bundle/openedge-abl-reference-117/page/GENERATE-UUID-function.html\">GENERATE-UUID function</a></div></div></nav><nav class=\"related-links\" role=\"navigation\"></nav></article></main></article>\n","isWatched":false,"labelText":"Product; Product > OpenEdge; Product > OpenEdge > Version 11.7; Format; Format > Documentation","likes":0,"likeurl":"https://docs-be.progress.com/like/309553","myDocsURL":null,"numOfPageViews":0,"numOfRatingsText":"<span>0 Ratings","revised":1470,"showWatch":false,"topicMeta":[["bookowner","oe11docs"],["bookrights","oe11docs"],["bundle","openedge-abl-reference-117"],["data","OEInformationHub/Product"],["data","OEInformationHub/Product/product_openedge"],["data","OEInformationHub/Product/product_openedge/product_openedge_117"],["data","OEInformationHub/format"],["data","OEInformationHub/format/format_documentation"],["organization","oe11docs"]],"topicTitle":"GENERATE-RANDOM-KEY function","topicurl":"https://docs-be.progress.com/bundle/openedge-abl-reference-117/page/GENERATE-RANDOM-KEY-function.html","type":"Manual"}